      "cpu1_pc": "0x4037cb95",
      "attestation": "Both serial receipts agree on the panic PC and a zero RTC interrupt raw word. Inspection of the original app's mapped instruction segment and literals confirms programming wake and reject configuration, clearing old wake and reject flags, setting STATE0.SLEEP_EN, and polling INT_RAW.SLP_WAKEUP or INT_RAW.SLP_REJECT.",
