      "compared_source_trees": "Retained November 17 ESP32-S3 IWDT trace source and November 18 7e63 native build source. The two audited files match byte for byte. The historical run's release executable and ROM were independently rehashed.",
      "files": {
        "hw/misc/esp32s3_rtc_cntl.c": "42895db5c8d1286452ebd61e1ac9bcf4fa2d23452db9db6290d70100f3fd665b",
        "hw/gpio/esp32s3_gpio_pad_aux.c": "52edd36d9b380b99ac7ece8ecb6a28ff37b79af14fabe8a31f04e03ddbf77c87"
      },
      "finding": "The RTC controller returns zero for the sleep wake/reject raw status and has no matching completion state or interrupt-clear semantics. Where pad emulation is active, it sees STATE0.SLEEP_EN and marks pad power history unknown without producing an RTC sleep completion. At IWDT in both runs, both SYSTIMER targets still generated alarms and their level-one interrupts were pending while guest acknowledgements had ceased."
    },
